<title>USA: Intel up after hours as earnings surprise.</title>
<headline>Intel up after hours as earnings surprise.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Intel Corp rose 4-3/8 to 112 after hours, traders said.</p>
<p>After the market closed, Intel said it earned $1.48 a share in the third quarter, compared to $1.05 the previous third quarter. The First Call consensus estimate was $1.25 a share.</p>
